# App Store window. Never install/remove/update. Run in both looks (Material 1040x720 at about 440,180; Glass 980x660 at about 470,210: read from shots).
ipc panels appStore
wait 1
rec open 3 ipc panels appStore
wait 2
shot open
note Window centred at 1040x720 (Material) or 980x660 (Glass); Discover selected, sections loading or loaded, search field has the caret. Compare window position and size with QML.
note Opening time (see rec open): Rust must not be slower than QML to first frame.
# Hover: place rows (left column), a card, a chip, the pill search
ptr move 520 330 sleep 400 glide 520 330 100
shot hover-place
note Hovered place row has the same tint as QML.
ptr move 900 500 sleep 400 glide 900 500 100
shot hover-card
note Hovered card has the same hover tint as QML.
ptr move 1100 290 sleep 400 glide 1100 290 100
shot hover-search
note Search pill keeps its tint while the pointer is over its text area (known not done in Rust: hover over the text); report the difference vs QML.
# Places
ptr move 520 400 sleep 300 glide 520 400 100 click
wait 1
shot place-dev
note After clicking a place (Development) heading and subtitle changed, loading shows, list scrolled to top, selected pill moved. Positions approximate: read the real place rows from the shot. NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
ptr move 520 330 sleep 300 glide 520 330 100 click
wait 1
shot place-discover
note Back on Discover: heading and subtitle changed back, selected pill moved. NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
# Typing
key -k Escape
ipc panels appStore
wait 2
key firefox
wait 1
shot typed
note Heading says Results for "firefox"; chips show; loading text names the repos and Flathub. Same words as QML.
key x
key x
wait 1
note Typed fast: only one load must follow (debounce); compare with QML.
key -k Escape
wait 1
shot esc-clear
note Esc clears the field and Discover returns after about 300 ms. Same as QML.
key aur: yay
wait 1
shot aur
note AUR chip is on and the subtitle says "Community packages from the AUR". Material: the chip width change is 150 ms OutCubic.
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl -k BackSpace
key zzzzqqq
wait 2
shot empty
note Empty state "No apps found for "zzzzqqq"" with the AUR hint. Same as QML.
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl -k BackSpace
wait 1
# Keyboard
key -k Tab
key -k Tab
key -k Tab
shot tab-focus
note A focus ring is visible on the focused place row, chip or card, like QML.
# Card page
ptr move 900 500 sleep 300 glide 900 500 100 click
wait 1
shot app-page
note App page shows logo, name, summary, chip, developer. Glass: Get or Open (plus Remove if installed). Material: split button and "About this app". NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
# Split menu (Material)
ptr move 1330 330 sleep 300 glide 1330 330 100 click
wait 1
shot split-menu
note Material only: menu opens below the caret, right-aligned, 8 px gap, with "Open the website" (if it has one) and "Copy the name"; the caret turns. Own popup, not clipped by the window.
key -k Escape
wait 1
shot split-closed
note Esc closes only the menu; the window stays.
# MANUAL: Tab through all places/chips/cards and Return opens; focus rings like QML (partly covered by tab-focus)
# MANUAL: split menu: click outside closes it, "Copy the name" closes it, focus lead button and Down twice must keep it open in QML
# MANUAL: AUR result page shows the warning card with votes and popularity (needs network)
# MANUAL: switch the look while the window is open (Settings > Appearance) and check it restyles
# MANUAL: close the window with Super+Q or hyprctl closewindow, then ipc panels appStore must open a fresh window
ipc panels close
